WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:06.770
Fight for your justice,
show your courage.

00:06.770 --> 00:10.370
Right! Grasp truth in these hands.

00:10.370 --> 00:13.780
Fight for your justice, I want you

00:13.780 --> 00:21.200
as you fight through
with your head held up high.

00:35.860 --> 00:39.930
Rather than polishing diamonds

00:43.040 --> 00:46.970
give me a glistening future.

00:50.250 --> 00:52.480
Even if nothing's there, get up.

00:52.480 --> 00:56.350
It's important to turn on the switch.

00:57.450 --> 01:00.220
Something new that I don't want to yield.

01:00.220 --> 01:04.750
Seeking it is justice!

01:06.360 --> 01:09.930
Fight for your justice,
be serious about it.

01:09.930 --> 01:13.540
Right! Face reality head on.

01:13.540 --> 01:16.940
Fight for your justice,
I love how you

01:16.940 --> 01:27.340
never give up even if
the current is against you.

01:36.020 --> 01:37.690
Good morning!

01:40.560 --> 01:42.430
H-Hello...

01:42.430 --> 01:44.930
- Thanks for the hard work!
- Now's no good.

01:44.930 --> 01:46.260
She's coming this way!

01:52.410 --> 01:55.140
I see. So that's what they're up to.

02:00.820 --> 02:03.420
But she'll find out real quick that way.

02:03.420 --> 02:06.290
There's no point to this if she runs.

02:06.290 --> 02:09.720
It's the same again and again every year.

02:13.290 --> 02:14.960
Leader!

02:18.970 --> 02:20.630
It's nothing.

02:26.240 --> 02:27.510
Hey, Bel...

02:27.510 --> 02:31.140
If you want stuff in the cake,
tell me now. If it's later...

02:33.920 --> 02:35.350
What?

02:35.350 --> 02:36.320
Meia!

02:36.320 --> 02:39.420
Y-You were here?

02:39.420 --> 02:41.890
You have to let steam out sometimes.

02:41.890 --> 02:44.480
Oh, cooking is so fun!

02:50.470 --> 02:53.430
Oh, no! I have to go back to the bridge!

02:53.430 --> 02:55.070
Me, too!

02:55.070 --> 02:56.440
M-Me, too!

02:56.440 --> 02:58.610
Why are you going to the bridge?

02:58.610 --> 03:01.070
I don't know why, but I'm just going!

03:02.640 --> 03:05.150
What's that?

03:05.150 --> 03:07.150
Everyone's acting strange, right?

03:07.150 --> 03:09.480
What happened, Big Sister?

03:09.480 --> 03:12.150
Tomorrow is my birthday.

03:12.150 --> 03:15.160
Could it be a surprise party?

03:15.160 --> 03:19.460
But you don't look too thrilled about it.

03:19.460 --> 03:21.760
I don't like big riots.

03:21.760 --> 03:24.700
Especially if I'm the reason for it.

03:24.700 --> 03:26.600
I can't help but think it a nuisance.

03:28.140 --> 03:29.800
W-What?

03:29.800 --> 03:33.740
Stoicism is what's
so wonderful about you.

03:35.780 --> 03:38.050
That annoyed look is great, too!

03:38.050 --> 03:39.250
Misty!

03:39.250 --> 03:40.280
Does she know?

03:40.280 --> 03:41.520
No way...

03:41.520 --> 03:43.250
What are you doing?

03:44.790 --> 03:46.520
W-What?

03:46.520 --> 03:51.090
Well, we're secretly planning
a birthday party for the leader.

03:51.090 --> 03:54.060
Everyone's gonna surprise Meia, ribbit!

03:54.060 --> 03:56.970
Kinda like when you had that hamburger?

03:56.970 --> 04:00.070
It's not bad if I can have yummy food...

04:00.070 --> 04:04.410
But it's her birthday,
and she's never happy about it.

04:04.410 --> 04:07.380
She escapes them every year.

04:07.380 --> 04:10.450
Well, she is kinda gloomy.

04:10.450 --> 04:13.850
But surprising her isn't a bad idea.

04:13.850 --> 04:16.250
All right! I'll lend you guys a hand!

04:16.250 --> 04:17.790
- Really?
- Really?

04:17.790 --> 04:19.750
First, you have to strike early.

04:19.750 --> 04:21.520
What happened last year?

04:27.030 --> 04:28.930
Parfet, what are you doing?

04:28.930 --> 04:31.700
I didn't hear plans for major maintenance!

04:31.700 --> 04:34.240
Sorry, I suddenly had the time...

04:34.240 --> 04:36.600
I'll get it all done in one day!

04:36.600 --> 04:38.270
But...

04:40.740 --> 04:42.110
Hangar here.

04:42.110 --> 04:44.150
I kept her from Dread-hopping.

04:44.150 --> 04:45.380
Parfet, thank you!

04:45.380 --> 04:48.720
This is bad for my heart.

04:48.720 --> 04:51.190
That finishes the first step.

04:51.190 --> 04:53.350
It's too early to relax.

04:53.350 --> 04:55.860
Next up...

04:55.860 --> 04:57.790
An interesting sight.

04:57.790 --> 05:02.030
The two genders in a secret debate.

05:02.030 --> 05:04.630
Q-Quit thinking weird things like that!

05:04.630 --> 05:07.170
There's a reason for this!

05:07.170 --> 05:08.730
A reason?

05:17.680 --> 05:19.150
Jura!

05:19.150 --> 05:21.120
What are you doing here?

05:21.120 --> 05:23.620
They're not letting me in.

05:23.620 --> 05:27.620
They said they'd come up with
a new Dread formation themselves.

05:27.620 --> 05:28.860
That's troublesome.

05:28.860 --> 05:32.260
I wanted to make plans for
when all ships fuse together...

05:35.060 --> 05:37.330
Want a call when they're done?

05:38.730 --> 05:40.390
No, it's fine.

05:45.310 --> 05:47.110
Meeting room here.

05:47.110 --> 05:49.910
I don't want to do anything like this again!

05:49.910 --> 05:51.350
All right, all right.

05:51.350 --> 05:52.950
Thanks, Jura!

05:52.950 --> 05:55.780
Now, how will she move next...

05:55.780 --> 05:58.290
Maybe the captain or the vice-captain?

05:58.290 --> 05:59.420
That's no good.

05:59.420 --> 06:02.320
It's over if she complains
to the captain, ribbit!

06:02.320 --> 06:05.790
And in that case, we have
to decide Meia's actions for her.

06:05.790 --> 06:07.450
What will we do?

06:08.800 --> 06:15.140
Pyoro-2 is so cute.

06:15.140 --> 06:19.610
W-What is this feeling of danger?

06:19.610 --> 06:21.480
Let Meia baby-sit?

06:21.480 --> 06:22.580
That's right!

06:22.580 --> 06:25.410
Just while we're getting
ready for the surprise party.

06:25.410 --> 06:29.280
I'm fine with that,
but what would Pyoro say?

06:29.280 --> 06:30.820
I-It's all right!

06:30.820 --> 06:33.190
We're done discussing it with Pyoro...

06:33.190 --> 06:34.460
We're nowhere near...

06:34.460 --> 06:36.560
- Quiet!
- You can't!

06:36.560 --> 06:40.360
It's true she might be
a little shy if it's just Pyoro.

06:40.360 --> 06:43.630
All right, I'll ask Meia about it.

06:43.630 --> 06:46.030
Thanks, Ezra!

06:46.030 --> 06:47.640
Ezra?

06:47.640 --> 06:49.470
I might be out of order

06:49.470 --> 06:53.340
but isn't Pyoro taking care
of the child all the time lately?

06:53.340 --> 06:57.250
Oh, because he volunteers,
so it's becoming habit...

06:57.250 --> 07:02.180
I won't say it's bad,
but is it all right?

07:02.180 --> 07:05.320
Sometimes, I'm not sure...

07:05.320 --> 07:07.180
how to handle her.

07:13.260 --> 07:14.700
This is a problem...

07:14.700 --> 07:16.460
What should we do?

07:16.460 --> 07:18.330
Leader, where are you going?

07:18.330 --> 07:20.230
To see the captain.

07:24.070 --> 07:26.740
Oh, it's a problem.

07:26.740 --> 07:28.210
Is something wrong?

07:28.210 --> 07:30.710
Everyone's busy, so we're in a bind.

07:30.710 --> 07:32.850
Oh, could you be free, Meia?

07:32.850 --> 07:34.350
I'm so glad!

07:34.350 --> 07:36.580
That's right! You're here, Leader!

07:36.580 --> 07:38.890
Why didn't I realize sooner?

07:38.890 --> 07:40.690
Wait, what's this about?

07:40.690 --> 07:42.350
Hey, come on out!

07:45.790 --> 07:47.200
W-What is this?

07:47.200 --> 07:47.430
Here.

07:47.430 --> 07:49.160
Dita, not so rough!
Here.

07:49.160 --> 07:49.900
Meia, how are you holding her?

07:49.900 --> 07:50.970
Meia, how are you holding her?
We were in a bind with
no one free to watch Kahlua.

07:50.970 --> 07:53.070
- It's almost nap time.
- Damn you!
We were in a bind with
no one free to watch Kahlua.

07:53.070 --> 07:53.570
Gently tuck her in!
We were in a bind with
no one free to watch Kahlua.

07:53.570 --> 07:54.800
Gently tuck her in!
But I'm so glad!

07:54.800 --> 07:55.070
Gently tuck her in!
Now everyone can work!

07:55.070 --> 07:57.040
When she wakes up,
be sure to feed her milk.
Now everyone can work!

07:57.040 --> 07:58.110
When she wakes up,
be sure to feed her milk.
Hold on!

07:58.110 --> 07:58.610
When she wakes up,
be sure to feed her milk.
There are more qualified...

07:58.610 --> 07:59.940
If she doesn't drink it all at once,
split it into multiple feedings!
There are more qualified...

07:59.940 --> 08:01.240
If she doesn't drink it all at once,
split it into multiple feedings!
I see.

08:01.240 --> 08:03.480
If she doesn't drink it all at once,
split it into multiple feedings!
Someone who claims there's
nothing she can't do...

08:03.480 --> 08:04.110
Don't forget to burp her!
Someone who claims there's
nothing she can't do...

08:04.110 --> 08:05.210
Don't forget to burp her!
Is crying over taking care of a baby.

08:05.210 --> 08:06.710
Gently tap her back...
is crying over taking care of a baby.

08:06.710 --> 08:06.810
Don't make her cry!
Is crying over taking care of a baby.

08:06.810 --> 08:09.480
Don't make her cry!
I didn't say that!

08:09.480 --> 08:09.720
Don't make her cry!

08:09.720 --> 08:11.490
Pyoro-2...

08:11.490 --> 08:13.220
Live a great life!

08:13.220 --> 08:13.390
Live a great life!
Then we're trusting you!

08:13.390 --> 08:15.990
I'll make sure to come save you!
Then we're trusting you!

08:15.990 --> 08:18.190
Pyoro-2...
Do your best!

08:18.190 --> 08:19.850
Shut up already!

08:22.230 --> 08:24.460
I can't believe they set me up so well...

08:29.440 --> 08:31.710
Come in.

08:31.710 --> 08:34.810
U-Um, did I do something?

08:34.810 --> 08:36.040
It's not that.

08:36.040 --> 08:38.680
The talk we had about
the baby worried me.

08:38.680 --> 08:39.750
Come, sit down.

08:39.750 --> 08:42.480
Sure...

08:42.480 --> 08:45.290
What about Kahlua?

08:45.290 --> 08:49.290
I don't have experience,
so I don't know what is right.

08:49.290 --> 08:54.230
But at the least, I think parents
are most important for a child.

08:55.830 --> 08:59.200
You don't need manuals
for the growing process.

08:59.200 --> 09:03.540
Parent and child bond as they
learn through trial and error.

09:03.540 --> 09:05.200
Isn't that so?

09:05.870 --> 09:06.870
But...

09:06.870 --> 09:09.740
I'm worried.

09:09.740 --> 09:15.420
If I make a mistake raising her,
and she becomes a bad girl...

09:15.420 --> 09:17.150
I'm always worried.

09:17.150 --> 09:20.390
But I can't consult anyone.

09:20.390 --> 09:24.890
When we someday go back
to Mejale and rejoin her ohma...

09:24.890 --> 09:28.890
When I think how she would
be disliked because of me...

09:31.400 --> 09:35.000
Ezra, you don't have to
think about it by yourself.

09:35.000 --> 09:38.300
That child is not just yours.

09:39.510 --> 09:43.510
She was the first
child born aboard this ship.

09:43.510 --> 09:46.080
In other words,
the daughter of us all.

09:46.080 --> 09:49.750
If you have a problem raising her,
then ask the crew.

09:49.750 --> 09:52.790
Because everyone here is her parent.

09:52.790 --> 09:54.450
Okay.

10:13.440 --> 10:15.880
What should I do?

10:15.880 --> 10:18.280
How do I stop the crying?

10:27.760 --> 10:30.420
I'm in a bind...

10:30.420 --> 10:32.760
Now's not good. Meia's coming.

10:35.530 --> 10:36.830
Warehouse here.

10:36.830 --> 10:38.330
Meia and Kahlua passed by.

10:38.330 --> 10:40.630
She's coming! Everyone, hide!

10:46.510 --> 10:49.610
What in the world is bothering you?

10:49.610 --> 10:54.050
But then, you're not going to answer me...

10:54.050 --> 10:57.250
Pyoro-2...

10:57.250 --> 10:59.740
- Pyoro-2!
- You're annoying so stay here!

11:01.720 --> 11:03.490
- What's this?
- The enemy!

11:03.490 --> 11:05.530
They hid in the gas clouds!

11:05.530 --> 11:08.520
They were ready to attack
and have already surrounded us!

11:11.230 --> 11:13.230
All ships, prepare for battle.

11:13.230 --> 11:15.360
- Misty, bridge.
- Roger!

11:17.610 --> 11:19.130
At a time like this?

11:38.090 --> 11:40.630
Dread team, are you ready yet?

11:40.630 --> 11:41.700
This is Jura.

11:41.700 --> 11:43.930
I can't find Meia.

11:43.930 --> 11:45.590
What?

11:47.800 --> 11:49.300
At a time like this?

11:49.300 --> 11:51.340
Just you watch!

11:51.340 --> 11:54.030
Go!

11:55.210 --> 11:56.280
No way!

11:56.280 --> 11:57.510
You're no ghost!

11:57.510 --> 12:00.450
Appear, disappear, make up your mind!

12:00.450 --> 12:01.880
Oh, I'm sorry...

12:01.880 --> 12:03.220
Meia, where are you?

12:03.220 --> 12:04.690
Enemy approaching.

12:04.690 --> 12:06.850
Isn't the Dread team ready yet?

12:06.850 --> 12:08.490
I'm taking command!

12:08.490 --> 12:11.230
Team leaders, switch data frequencies!

12:11.230 --> 12:12.560
Roger!

12:12.560 --> 12:13.790
Leader...

12:13.790 --> 12:16.800
If you're worried,
get rid of the enemies quickly.

12:16.800 --> 12:18.460
R-Roger!

12:23.000 --> 12:24.940
The marker function doesn't work.

12:24.940 --> 12:27.340
And I can't use
the communication system.

12:31.610 --> 12:35.950
To end up in an obsolete
escape pod of all things...

12:38.920 --> 12:41.360
So carefree...

12:41.360 --> 12:43.420
I won't give up.

12:43.420 --> 12:46.690
I don't know what Pyoro
would tell me later.

12:52.470 --> 12:53.530
No good.

12:53.530 --> 12:55.270
It goes invisible too fast.

12:55.270 --> 12:56.440
Calm down.

12:56.440 --> 12:59.840
They look different,
but we're facing programmed machines!

12:59.840 --> 13:01.980
Find the pattern and get around it.

13:01.980 --> 13:03.980
What's wrong, Jura?

13:03.980 --> 13:06.780
You're like someone else today. Reliable.

13:06.780 --> 13:09.350
When I feel like doing it, I do it!

13:09.350 --> 13:11.590
I have to do my best...

13:11.590 --> 13:15.280
I don't want to see what
happened to Ms. Gasco again.

13:17.290 --> 13:18.660
That's true.

13:18.660 --> 13:21.260
This is where we have to hold out.

13:21.260 --> 13:22.230
Let's go, Jura!

13:22.230 --> 13:23.560
Yeah!

13:25.830 --> 13:28.870
I won't let them take all the good stuff.

13:28.870 --> 13:30.530
That's right!

13:32.970 --> 13:34.580
Then let's get at it!

13:34.580 --> 13:35.910
Right!

13:39.950 --> 13:44.150
No sign of Big Sister
and Kahlua on this ship.

13:44.150 --> 13:45.620
Vice-captain!

13:45.620 --> 13:48.620
One of the life pods is missing!

13:48.620 --> 13:50.290
I-Impossible...

13:50.290 --> 13:51.890
Go to the radar room, Ezra.

13:51.890 --> 13:53.860
Work with Pyoro to find the pod.

13:53.860 --> 13:55.130
A-All right.

13:55.130 --> 13:57.130
I'll go with you.

13:57.130 --> 13:59.000
Ms. Ezra, everything's all right!

13:59.000 --> 14:01.570
Big Sister's with her.

14:01.570 --> 14:03.230
Yeah...

14:24.120 --> 14:24.760
They dodged!

14:24.760 --> 14:26.420
Where are they?

14:28.530 --> 14:30.560
Damn it!

14:30.560 --> 14:35.470
I can't tell where they're coming from.

14:35.470 --> 14:37.570
I'm leaving you with that big one!

14:37.570 --> 14:40.110
Make sure to get rid of it!

14:40.110 --> 14:41.770
I know!

14:43.580 --> 14:46.480
Its mood gets worse
if I do something wrong.

14:46.480 --> 14:48.240
Just like a baby.

14:52.120 --> 14:55.380
It's not that I was badmouthing you.

14:58.630 --> 15:00.290
Impossible...

15:04.630 --> 15:06.570
We've cleared out most of them here!

15:06.570 --> 15:08.230
And you, Dita?

15:10.340 --> 15:12.240
Damn, where are they?

15:12.240 --> 15:13.970
Mr. Alien, above us!

15:20.810 --> 15:22.480
Damn it!

15:24.180 --> 15:26.240
That pisses me off!

15:29.520 --> 15:31.720
What? What's wrong?

15:35.400 --> 15:37.060
Mr. Alien!

15:38.370 --> 15:40.030
Mr. Alien...

15:41.140 --> 15:42.340
Where...

15:42.340 --> 15:43.400
Where are you?

15:43.400 --> 15:45.110
Pyoro-2...

15:45.110 --> 15:47.140
The gas clouds are too much.

15:47.140 --> 15:50.440
Finding a small pod is a tough job.

15:50.440 --> 15:56.180
There may be tons of space junk,
but there's only one Pyoro-2!

15:56.180 --> 15:59.590
God, please save my baby.

15:59.590 --> 16:02.820
I'll never be so spineless again...

16:05.290 --> 16:06.930
Big Sister...

16:06.930 --> 16:08.590
Where are you?

16:15.340 --> 16:17.000
Meia...

16:19.710 --> 16:21.640
Meia...

16:21.640 --> 16:26.050
Your ohma didn't scold
you because she hated you.

16:26.050 --> 16:28.750
She wanted you to understand.

16:28.750 --> 16:34.090
We might not live to see
this planet become green earth.

16:34.090 --> 16:36.820
But we are never going to give up.

16:36.820 --> 16:40.860
For all of you,
who we'll pass our futures on to.

16:40.860 --> 16:47.370
Your mother and everyone
else were all loved by our mothers.

16:47.370 --> 16:51.840
That's why when you were born,
I promised your ohma...

16:51.840 --> 16:57.880
that we would give to you all
the love the two of us received.

16:57.880 --> 17:00.710
Meia, don't forget.

17:00.710 --> 17:03.280
No matter how far away we are

17:03.280 --> 17:06.880
we will always look after you.

17:15.900 --> 17:18.970
I was finally able to realize something.

17:18.970 --> 17:22.670
Just how much I was
cherished by my parents.

17:22.670 --> 17:25.510
It's my turn now.

17:25.510 --> 17:26.610
Yes.

17:26.610 --> 17:29.540
All the love that my parents gave me...

17:29.540 --> 17:33.540
I need to entrust it
to the next generation.

17:52.330 --> 17:55.270
I'll never let you die!

18:00.540 --> 18:03.210
What are you doing? Killing yourselves?

18:03.210 --> 18:04.870
You're telling me...

18:09.980 --> 18:13.350
Are you saying they have some plan?

18:17.760 --> 18:19.420
Dita!

18:21.500 --> 18:24.730
If you can't push, pull!

18:34.640 --> 18:36.640
I swear.

18:36.640 --> 18:39.450
That's a tactic that
only men can think of.

18:39.450 --> 18:40.880
Radar room here.

18:40.880 --> 18:43.250
A different enemy force is in the area.

18:43.250 --> 18:44.550
But it's strange.

18:44.550 --> 18:47.820
They're heading for a different
coordinate instead of here.

18:47.820 --> 18:49.320
Meia and the baby!

18:49.320 --> 18:51.330
They're after the pod!

18:51.330 --> 18:52.430
BC!

18:52.430 --> 18:55.050
Dread team, all ships to
the specified coordinates!

19:03.240 --> 19:04.910
Don't worry.

19:04.910 --> 19:07.640
As long as I stay still, I can buy time.

19:15.150 --> 19:17.850
The enemy sniffed us out.

19:20.520 --> 19:23.960
If they're going to take
me and tear me to pieces...

19:31.900 --> 19:33.030
Don't worry.

19:33.030 --> 19:35.760
I'm sure everyone will find you.

19:45.810 --> 19:48.210
- We were in time!
- Pyoro-2!

19:54.420 --> 19:56.290
Sorry to keep you waiting!

19:56.290 --> 20:00.260
Next time, give me a
heads-up before you take off!

20:00.260 --> 20:03.100
I need to give Parfet a piece of my mind.

20:03.100 --> 20:04.700
Pyoro-2!

20:04.700 --> 20:06.770
No, let me hold her!

20:06.770 --> 20:08.600
I was worried about you!

20:08.600 --> 20:10.340
I'm her mother!

20:10.340 --> 20:12.810
Pyoro-2 is my dear, little baby!

20:12.810 --> 20:15.440
I told you her name is Kahlua!

20:15.440 --> 20:17.280
She started crying!

20:17.280 --> 20:19.210
- Hand her over!
- No!

20:27.290 --> 20:29.920
So you like me, huh?

20:29.920 --> 20:31.190
You do, right?

20:31.190 --> 20:34.290
Because we were in a
life-or-death situation together.

20:35.300 --> 20:37.330
- All right...
- Meia...

20:37.330 --> 20:38.700
You're so good.

20:38.700 --> 20:40.360
She's smiling.

20:42.340 --> 20:45.270
That face is the most beautiful.

20:48.510 --> 20:50.170
Thanks.

20:53.280 --> 20:55.850
Big Sister!

20:55.850 --> 20:57.250
Welcome back!

20:57.250 --> 20:58.920
How are you doing?

20:58.920 --> 21:00.120
No worries.

21:00.120 --> 21:01.710
Thanks, Misty.

21:04.220 --> 21:07.330
You know, you seem a little different.

21:07.330 --> 21:09.100
- You think so?
- Yeah!

21:09.100 --> 21:11.530
You seem more wonderful than before.

21:11.530 --> 21:12.900
That's spooky.

21:12.900 --> 21:14.840
Are you up to something, too?

21:14.840 --> 21:17.970
It's nothing like that!

21:17.970 --> 21:19.340
Ready...

21:19.340 --> 21:24.440
Happy birthday, Meia!

21:24.440 --> 21:27.070
Huh? Meia... Are you mad?
